	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/versions.jpg"

a "new file dialog" is a view:
	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/new-file.jpg"

a "new project dialog" is a view:
	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/new-project.jpg"

a "duplicate project dialog" is a view:
	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/duplicate-project.jpg"

a "change this dialog" is a view:
	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/change-this.jpg"

