	- its thumbnail is "snapshots/sign-in.jpg"

spell app is a site:
	- it has a home page at "/", named "Home", old , colored red
	- it has a notebook page at "/edit/@spell/guides/SpellUI/:notebook*", named "Notebook", old , colored orange
	- it has a guide page at "/edit/@spell/guides/:guide", named "Guide", old , colored yellow
	- it has a code editor page at "/edit/:project*", named "Edit", old , colored olive
		it has a running app page at "/run/:project*", named "Run", old
	- it has a site editor page at "/site/:project*", named "Site Editor", old , colored green
	- it has a theme editor page at "/theme", named "Theme Editor", old , colored teal
	- it has a hosted app page at "/apps/:project*", named "Hosted App", old , colored blue
		it has a terms page at "/terms", named "Terms", old
	- it has an inspector sidebar
	- it has a palette sidebar
	- it has a site data sidebar
	- it has a project settings dialog
	- it has a code settings dialog
	- it has a project versions dialog
	- it has a new file dialog
	- it has a new project dialog
	- it has a duplicate project dialog
	- it has a change this dialog
	- it has a publish clash dialog
	- it has a person dialog
	- it has a sign-in dialog
	- it has a not found page
	- it has an error page
